{"title":"43","section":"1471h","heading":"Availability of appropriations for uniforms or allowances","lead":"Appropriations available to the Department of the Interior for salaries and expenses shall on and after December 8, 2004, be available for uniforms or allowances therefor, as authorized by law (5 U.S.C. 5901–5902 and D.C. Code 4–204).","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"miscellaneous","heading":"Prior Similar Provisions","text":"Provisions similar to those in this section were contained in the following prior appropriation acts: Pub. L. 108–108, title I, § 105, Nov. 10, 2003, 117 Stat. 1266. Pub. L. 108–7, div. F, title I, § 105, Feb. 20, 2003, 117 Stat. 238. Pub. L. 107–63, title I, § 105, Nov. 5, 2001, 115 Stat. 437. Pub. L. 106–291, title I, § 105, Oct. 11, 2000, 114 Stat. 942. Pub. L. 106–113, div. B, § 1000(a)(3) [title I, § 105], Nov. 29, 1999, 113 Stat. 1535, 1501A–156. Pub. L. 105–277, div. A, § 101(e) [title I, § 105], Oct. 21, 1998, 112 Stat. 2681–231, 2681–253. Pub. L. 105–83, title I, § 105, Nov. 14, 1997, 111 Stat. 1561. Pub. L. 104–208, div. A, title I, § 101(d) [title I, § 105], Sept. 30, 1996, 110 Stat. 3009–181, 3009–199. Pub. L. 104–134, title I, § 101(c) [title I, § 105], Apr. 26, 1996, 110 Stat. 1321–156, 1321–176; renumbered title I, Pub. L. 104–140, § 1(a), May 2, 1996, 110 Stat. 1327. Pub. L. 103–332, title I, § 105, Sept. 30, 1994, 108 Stat. 2518. Pub. L. 103–138, title I, § 105, Nov. 11, 1993, 107 Stat. 1398. Pub. L. 102–381, title I, § 105, Oct. 5, 1992, 106 Stat. 1396. Pub. L. 102–154, title I, § 105, Nov. 13, 1991, 105 Stat. 1011. Pub. L. 101–512, title I, § 105, Nov. 5, 1990, 1"}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 108–447, div. E, title I, § 105, Dec. 8, 2004, 118 Stat. 3063.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 43—","heading":"PUBLIC LANDS","identifier":"/us/usc/t43"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 31—","heading":"DEPARTMENT OF THE INTERIOR","identifier":"/us/usc/t43/ch31"}]}